       When alias database search fails, and the recipient localpart  contains
       the  optional  recipient  delimiter (e.g., _u_s_e_r_+_f_o_o), the search is re‐
       peated for the unextended address (e.g., _u_s_e_r).

       The pprrooppaaggaattee__uunnmmaattcchheedd__eexxtteennssiioonnss parameter controls  whether  an  un‐
       matched  address  extension (_+_f_o_o) is propagated to the result of table
       lookup.

